      "index": "conditional",
      "name": "ForceReplicateKennelEvents",
      "description": "Emitted only when @forceReplicateAllRunsForKennel != 'ignore'. Returns all events for that kennel (subject to same recent/followed/attended filter as NarrowEvents). Same columns as NarrowEvents. OPTION (RECOMPILE). Page size: 250.",
